I sit on a bench.
I look towards the water.
I take a deep breath.
The February breeze is very pleasant.
Passenger boats go across the water.
Some boats go to the left.
Other boats go to the right.
I see a small shop nearby.
I walk straight to the shop.
I get a hot tea and a pazham pori.
I come back to the bench.
I eat the pazham pori.
It is very tasty.
I drink the hot tea.
Morning slowly becomes afternoon.
I am in no hurry.
I sit there for a long time.
